<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wellman upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wellman upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch analyst John Roberts said he raised his near-term rating on Wellman Inc to accumulate from neutral, keeping a long-term buy on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said DuPont Co's acquisition of the polyethylene terephthalate, or PET, business of Imperial Chemical Industries Plc shows the &quot;validity&quot; of being in both polyester fiber and PET.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Wellman is already in both businesses,&quot; he said. &quot;We think Wellman is in a very strong position.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said Wellman's stock &quot;very cheap&quot; and put a $24-$25 12-month price target on the shares.</p>
</text>
